      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## A key that will not collide\n\n`const meta = Symbol(\"meta\")` is unique. `obj[meta] = \"hidden\"` does not show up in `Object.keys` or JSON by default.\n\nPrint the hidden meta field."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "keys-skip",
      "promptMd": "`Object.keys({ [Symbol(\"m\")]: 1 })` is…",
